menu "Smart-Air Gas Early Warning (QCVN 03:2019/BYT)"

    config SA_GAS_EWS_ARENA_SIZE
        int "TFLite Micro tensor arena for the gas_ews model (bytes)"
        default 16384
        range 4096 131072
        help
            Largest INT8 activation is 90x16 (1.4 KB); 16 KB is a safe
            first guess, NOT a measurement. The boot log prints
            "arena used X/Y B" -- trim to X plus some margin, or raise it if
            you see "AllocateTensors failed".

endmenu
